rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-02-21T13:39:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:13:19Z","closed_at":"2025-03-05T18:08:50Z","assignee":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- discovered in 4.4dev4.official\n- reproducible in 4.4beta4.official\n- broken in an entirely different way in 4.3.stable and earlier, see below\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta4 - Android - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Adreno (TM) 642L -  (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf an Android plugin (v1) returns a Kotlin `ByteArray` (or presumably Java `byte[]` but I have not tested that) the array will get mangled, all bytes are replaced by copies of the first byte.\nThis applies only for `ByteArray`s passed from the plugin to gdscript as a return value. \nA `PackedByteArray` being passed as a parameter from gdscript to the plugin is transferred correctly.\nA `ByteArray` being passed as a signal parameter from the plugin to gdscript is transferred correctly.\n\n\nSample data `\"Waiting for Godot™\".toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8)`\n\nExpected result:\n```\n57 61 69 74 69 6e 67 20 66 6f 72 20 47 6f 64 6f 74 e2 84 a2\n W  a  i  t  i  n  g     f  o  r     G  o  d  o  t ___TM___\n```\nObserved result:\n```\n57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57 57\n W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W  W\n```\n\nAndroid screen output from gdscript:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd859b37-0693-4bd0-91b6-e304e9632a12)\n\nAndroid console output from the plugin:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/845fef0e-027e-4ca4-8c35-786b0cbb4907)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the reproduction project on Android hardware via remote debugging.\n\nUse `adb logcat godot:I godot-test:D *:S` to see the console output.   \n'godot-test' show output from the plugin's point of view.\n\nThe `ByteArrayTest.kt` file includes the plugin's source code.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bytearray_bug_2025-02-21_14-15-02.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18907026/bytearray_bug_2025-02-21_14-15-02.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103127/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}